  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given vectors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;are co-planar, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
